      "id": 8362239426614,
      "title": "Brand New (Whirlpool) Gas Stove (WFG525S0JB)",
      "handle": "brand-new-whirlpool-gas-stove-wfg525s0jb",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>30 Inch Freestanding Gas Range with Frozen Bake™ Technology</strong><br><span>Skip preheating and cook frozen favorites like pizza and lasagna faster with Frozen Bake™ - pre-programmed settings that automatically adjust cooking times for you. The SpeedHeat™ burner generates 15,000 BTUs, the high heat needed to sear and boil quickly. This unit also comes equipped with an 8,000 BTU center oval burner that can easily fit large griddles and other longer cookware so they heat evenly on the range top. With the upswept SpillGuard™ cooktop, spills are contained by its raised edges and cleanup is a breeze. If you want to get dinner to the table faster with an easy cleanup, then this unit is for you.</span></p>",
