    {
      "id": 8362055139382,
      "title": "Brand New (Whirlpool) Electric Stove (WFE515S0JB)",
      "handle": "sin-nombre-26mar_14-23",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>30 Inch Freestanding Electric Range with FlexHeat™ Dual Radiant Element</strong></p>\n<p><br><span>With the FlexHeat™ dual radiant element you get two elements in one with a 6\" inner ring that's great for smaller pots and pans and a 9\" expandable outer ring that makes room for larger cookware. Frozen Bake™ technology allows you to skip preheating and cook frozen favorites like pizza and lasagna faster with preprogrammed settings that automatically adjust cooking times for you. Adjustable self-cleaning helps you clean without harsh chemicals or special cleaners by running this high-temperature setting that automatically cleans the oven according to a preprogrammed cycle.</span><br><br><span>The upswept SpillGuard™ cooktop makes clean up easier with a cooktop that has raised edges to help contain spills. Keep dishes ready to serve while you work on the rest of the meal by using the Keep Warm setting. This setting delivers low heat to the oven to keep prepared dishes from getting cold. Get evenly-baked food with a temperature sensor that monitors oven temperature and adjusts the cooking elements. Closed door broiling maintains the optimal cooking temperature for food while still keeping the kitchen comfortable and cool using this broiling temperature management system that helps prevent overheating.</span></p>",
