      "body_html": "<h2 class=\"border-bottom mt2\">Description</h2>\n<div class=\"mb2\"><strong>30 Inch Freestanding Upright Freezer with 18.0 cu. ft. Capacity</strong></div>\n<div class=\"mb2\">\n<br>Enjoy the convenience and simplicity of an all-freezer from Whirlpool. Activate fast freeze to rapidly drop the freezer's temperature to its lowest setting helping lock in freshness and flavor. With frost-free defrost you'll never have to empty your freezer for a manual defrost again, saving you time.</div>",
